Z||000056||sqoach||02-26-2001||09:23 PM||||here's the parts # for the radiator cap (10230 (16lb non-vented)) and the thermostat housing cap (10232). those are the stant brand. i'm not sure about the steam from the radiator. where exactly is the steam coming from?<P>and for the compression check, first you need a compression tester. do you have one?||||reg||1
